  "question": "A ball is projected at an angle of 45° with velocity 20 m/s. Find its range.",
  "gold_answer": "# Solved Numerical\n\n---\n\n## Projectile Tracking\n\n### Problem\nA ball is projected at an angle of $45^\\circ$ with a velocity of $20 \\text{ m/s}$. Find its horizontal range.\n\n### Given\n* Initial launch velocity ($u$) = $20 \\text{ m/s}$\n* Projection angle ($\\theta$) = $45^\\circ$\n* Acceleration due to gravity ($g$) = $9.8 \\text{ m/s}^2$\n\n### Formula\n$$R = \\frac{u^2 \\sin(2\\theta)}{g}$$\n\n### Substitution\n$$R = \\frac{(20)^2 \\times \\sin(2 \\times 45^\\circ)}{9.8}$$\n\n### Calculation\n$$R = \\frac{400 \\times \\sin(90^\\circ)}{9.8}$$\n\nSince $\\sin(90^\\circ) = 1$:\n$$R = \\frac{400 \\times 1}{9.8}$$\n\n$$R = 40.82 \\text{ m}$$\n\n### Final Answer\n**Horizontal Range ($R$) = $40.82 \\text{ m}$**\n\n### Interpretation\nThis means the ball travels a total horizontal ground shortcut distance of $40.82 \\text{ meters}$ away from its initial launch spot before striking the earth baseline.",
  "candidate_response": "<thinking>\nThe user wants to find the range of a projectile launched at 45° with velocity 20 m/s. Let me calculate this and present it in the new structured UI block format.\n\nRange formula: R = v²sin(2θ)/g\n\nR = (20)² × sin(90°) / 10\nR = 400 × 1 / 10\nR = 40 m\n\nLet me structure this as a proper interactive textbook response with cards.\n</thinking>\n\nimport { useState } from \"react\";\n\nconst g = 9.8;\n\nfunction FormulaCard({ title, formula, variables, children }) {\n  const [showExplain, setShowExplain] = useState(false);\n  const [openLab, setOpenLab] = useState(false);\n  const [v, setV] = useState(20);\n  const [angle, setAngle] = useState(45);\n\n  const labRange = ((v * v * Math.sin((2 * angle * Math.PI) / 180)) / g).toFixed(2);\n\n  return (\n    <div style={{\n      border: \"1.5px solid #6366f1\",\n      borderRadius: 14,\n      padding: \"20px 24px\",\n      background: \"linear-gradient(135deg,#1e1b4b 0%,#312e81 100%)\",\n      color: \"#e0e7ff\",\n      marginBottom: 18,\n      boxShadow: \"0 4px 24px #6366f133\"\n    }}>\n      <div style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: \"#a5b4fc\", textTransform: \"uppercase\", marginBottom: 8 }}>\n        📐 {title}\n      </div>\n      <div style={{\n        background: \"#0f0a2e\",\n        borderRadius: 10,\n        padding: \"16px\",\n        textAlign: \"center\",\n        fontSize: 22,\n        margin: \"10px 0 16px\",\n        border: \"1px solid #4338ca\"\n      }}>\n        {formula}\n      </div>\n\n      <div style={{ display: \"flex\", gap: 10, flexWrap: \"wrap\", marginBottom: 10 }}>\n        <button\n          onClick={() => { setShowExplain(s => !s); setOpenLab(false); }}\n          style={{\n            background: showExplain ? \"#6366f1\" : \"transparent\",\n            border: \"1.5px solid #6366f1\",\n            color: \"#e0e7ff\",\n            borderRadius: 8,\n            padding: \"7px 18px\",\n            cursor: \"pointer\",\n            fontWeight: 600,\n            fontSize: 13,\n            transition: \"background 0.2s\"\n          }}>\n          {showExplain ? \"▼ Hide Explanation\" : \"▶ Explain Formula\"}\n        </button>\n        <button\n          onClick={() => { setOpenLab(s => !s); setShowExplain(false); }}\n          style={{\n            background: openLab ? \"#7c3aed\" : \"transparent\",\n            border: \"1.5px solid #7c3aed\",\n            color: \"#e0e7ff\",\n            borderRadius: 8,\n            padding: \"7px 18px\",\n            cursor: \"pointer\",\n            fontWeight: 600,\n            fontSize: 13,\n            transition: \"background 0.2s\"\n          }}>\n          {openLab ? \"✕ Close Lab\" : \"⚗ Open Formula Lab\"}\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n      {showExplain && (\n        <div style={{\n          background: \"#1e1b4b\",\n          borderRadius: 10,\n          padding: \"14px 18px\",\n          marginTop: 8,\n          borderLeft: \"3px solid #6366f1\",\n          fontSize: 14,\n          lineHeight: 1.8\n        }}>\n          {variables.map((v, i) => (\n            <div key={i} style={{ marginBottom: 4 }}>\n              <span style={{ color: \"#a5b4fc\", fontWeight: 700 }}>{v.symbol}</span>\n              <span style={{ color: \"#c7d2fe\" }}> — {v.meaning}</span>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {openLab && (\n        <div style={{\n          background: \"#0f0a2e\",\n          borderRadius: 10,\n          padding: \"16px 18px\",\n          marginTop: 8,\n          border: \"1px dashed #7c3aed\"\n        }}>\n          <div style={{ fontSize: 12, color: \"#a5b4fc\", letterSpacing: 1, marginBottom: 12, textTransform: \"uppercase\" }}>\n            ⚗ Interactive Formula Lab\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ display: \"flex\", gap: 24, flexWrap: \"wrap\", marginBottom: 14 }}>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: 13, color: \"#c7d2fe\" }}>\n              Velocity (m/s)\n              <br />\n              <input\n                type=\"range\" min={5} max={100} value={v}\n                onChange={e => setV(Number(e.target.value))}\n                style={{ width: 140, accentColor: \"#6366f1\", marginTop: 4 }}\n              />\n              <span style={{ marginLeft: 8, fontWeight: 700, color: \"#a5b4fc\" }}>{v} m/s</span>\n            </label>\n            <label style={{ fontSize: 13, color: \"#c7d2fe\" }}>\n              Angle (°)\n              <br />\n              <input\n                type=\"range\" min={1} max={89} value={angle}\n                onChange={e => setAngle(Number(e.target.value))}\n                style={{ width: 140, accentColor: \"#7c3aed\", marginTop: 4 }}\n              />\n              <span style={{ marginLeft: 8, fontWeight: 700, color: \"#a5b4fc\" }}>{angle}°</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n          <div style={{\n            background: \"#1e1b4b\",\n            borderRadius: 8,\n            padding: \"12px 16px\",\n            fontSize: 15,\n            color: \"#e0e7ff\"\n          }}>\n            Range &nbsp;=&nbsp;\n            <span style={{ color: \"#facc15\", fontWeight: 700, fontSize: 20 }}>{labRange} m</span>\n            <span style={{ fontSize: 11, color: \"#818cf8\", marginLeft: 10 }}>\n              (g = {g} m/s²)\n            </span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction SectionCard({ icon, title, color, children }) {\n  return (\n    <div style={{\n      border: `1.5px solid ${color}33`,\n      borderRadius: 14,\n      padding: \"18px 22px\",\n      background: \"#0f172a\",\n      marginBottom: 16,\n      boxShadow: `0 2px 12px ${color}18`\n    }}>\n      <div style={{\n        fontSize: 11,\n        letterSpacing: 2,\n        color: color,\n        textTransform: \"uppercase\",\n        fontWeight: 700,\n        marginBottom: 10\n      }}>\n        {icon} {title}\n      </div>\n      {children}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction StepRow({ num, label, value, highlight }) {\n  return (\n    <div style={{\n      display: \"flex\",\n      alignItems: \"flex-start\",\n      gap: 14,\n      padding: \"10px 0\",\n      borderBottom: \"1px solid #1e293b\"\n    }}>\n      <div style={{\n        minWidth: 28, height: 28,\n        background: highlight ? \"#6366f1\" : \"#1e293b\",\n        borderRadius: \"50%\",\n        display: \"flex\", alignItems: \"center\", justifyContent: \"center\",\n        fontWeight: 700, fontSize: 13, color: \"#e0e7ff\", flexShrink: 0\n      }}>\n        {num}\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div style={{ fontSize: 13, color: \"#94a3b8\", marginBottom: 3 }}>{label}</div>\n        <div style={{ fontSize: 15, color: \"#e0e7ff\", fontWeight: highlight ? 700 : 400 }}>{value}</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default function ProjectileRange() {\n  const R = ((20 * 20 * Math.sin(Math.PI / 2)) / g).toFixed(2);\n\n  return (\n    <div style={{\n      fontFamily: \"'Inter', sans-serif\",\n      maxWidth: 680,\n      margin: \"0 auto\",\n      padding: \"24px 16px\",\n      background: \"#060b18\",\n      minHeight: \"100vh\",\n      color: \"#e2e8f0\"\n    }}>\n\n      {/* Topic Header */}\n      <div style={{\n        background: \"linear-gradient(135deg,#1e1b4b,#0f172a)\",\n        borderRadius: 16,\n        padding: \"22px 26px\",\n        marginBottom: 20,\n        borderLeft: \"4px solid #6366f1\"\n      }}>\n        <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: \"#818cf8\", letterSpacing: 2, textTransform: \"uppercase\", marginBottom: 6 }}>\n          Chapter · Projectile Motion\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 700, color: \"#e0e7ff\", marginBottom: 6 }}>\n          Range of a Projectile\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ fontSize: 14, color: \"#94a3b8\" }}>\n          Given: Initial velocity <strong style={{color:\"#a5b4fc\"}}>u = 20 m/s</strong>, Angle <strong style={{color:\"#a5b4fc\"}}>θ = 45°</strong>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Quick Definition */}\n      <SectionCard icon=\"📖\" title=\"Quick Definition\" color=\"#38bdf8\">\n        <p style={{ fontSize: 14, color: \"#cbd5e1\", lineHeight: 1.8, margin: 0 }}>\n          The <strong style={{color:\"#38bdf8\"}}>Range</strong> of a projectile is the <em>horizontal distance</em> it\n          travels from the launch point until it returns to the same vertical level.\n          It depends on the initial speed and the launch angle.\n        </p>\n      </SectionCard>\n\n      {/* Formula Card */}\n      <FormulaCard\n        title=\"Range Formula\"\n        formula={\n          <span>\n            {katex ? null : null}\n            R = u²·sin(2θ) / g\n          </span>\n        }\n        variables={[\n          { symbol: \"R\", meaning: \"Horizontal range (metres)\" },\n          { symbol: \"u\", meaning: \"Initial velocity (m/s)\" },\n          { symbol: \"θ\", meaning: \"Projection angle (degrees)\" },\n          { symbol: \"g\", meaning: \"Acceleration due to gravity = 9.8 m/s²\" },\n          { symbol: \"sin(2θ)\", meaning: \"Sine of twice the launch angle\" },\n        ]}\n      />\n\n      {/* Step-by-Step Solution */}\n      <SectionCard icon=\"🧮\" title=\"Step-by-Step Solution\" color=\"#34d399\">\n        <StepRow num={1} label=\"Write known values\"\n          value=\"u = 20 m/s,  θ = 45°,  g = 9.8 m/s²\" />\n        <StepRow num={2} label=\"Compute 2θ\"\n          value=\"2 × 45° = 90°\" />\n        <StepRow num={3} label=\"Find sin(2θ)\"\n          value=\"sin(90°) = 1  ← maximum possible value\" />\n        <StepRow num={4} label=\"Substitute into R = u²·sin(2θ) / g\"\n          value=\"R = (20)² × 1 / 9.8 = 400 / 9.8\" />\n        <StepRow num={5} highlight label=\"Final Answer\"\n          value={`R ≈ ${R} metres`} />\n      </SectionCard>\n\n      {/* Result Banner */}\n      <div style={{\n        background: \"linear-gradient(90deg,#064e3b,#065f46)\",\n        border: \"1.5px solid #34d399\",\n        borderRadius: 14,\n        padding: \"18px 24px\",\n        display: \"flex\",\n        alignItems: \"center\",\n        justifyContent: \"space-between\",\n        marginBottom: 18,\n        flexWrap: \"wrap\",\n        gap: 12\n      }}>\n        <div>\n          <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: \"#6ee7b7\", letterSpacing: 2, textTransform: \"uppercase\" }}>\n            ✅ Result\n          </div>\n          <div style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 800, color: \"#ecfdf5\", marginTop: 4 }}>\n            R ≈ {R} m\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style={{\n          background: \"#065f46\",\n          borderRadius: 10,\n          padding: \"10px 16px\",\n          fontSize: 13,\n          color: \"#a7f3d0\",\n          lineHeight: 1.7\n        }}>\n          <div>u² = 400</div>\n          <div>sin(90°) = 1</div>\n          <div>g = 9.8 m/s²</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Key Insight */}\n      <SectionCard icon=\"💡\" title=\"Key Insight\" color=\"#fbbf24\">\n        <div style={{ display: \"flex\", flexDirection: \"column\", gap: 10 }}>\n          {[\n            [\"45° gives maximum range\", \"At θ = 45°, sin(2θ) = sin(90°) = 1, which is the maximum value of sine.\"],\n            [\"Complementary angles give equal range\", \"A ball at 30° and 60° will land at the same spot.\"],\n            [\"Range ∝ u²\", \"Doubling speed quadruples the range.\"],\n          ].map(([title, desc], i) => (\n            <div key={i} style={{\n              background: \"#1c1a0a\",\n              borderRadius: 8,\n              padding: \"10px 14px\",\n              borderLeft: \"3px solid #fbbf24\"\n            }}>\n              <div style={{ fontWeight: 700, color: \"#fde68a\", fontSize: 13 }}>{title}</div>\n              <div style={{ color: \"#d1d5db\", fontSize: 13, marginTop: 3 }}>{desc}</div>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      </SectionCard>\n\n      {/* Comparison Table */}\n      <SectionCard icon=\"📊\" title=\"Range at Different Angles (u = 20 m/s)\" color=\"#a78bfa\">\n        <div style={{ overflowX: \"auto\" }}>\n          <table style={{\n            width: \"100%\",\n            borderCollapse: \"collapse\",\n            fontSize: 13,\n            color: \"#e2e8f0\"\n          }}>\n            <thead>\n              <tr style={{ background: \"#1e1b4b\" }}>\n                {[\"Angle (θ)\", \"sin(2θ)\", \"Range (m)\"].map(h => (\n                  <th key={h} style={{\n                    padding: \"10px 14px\",\n                    textAlign: \"center\",\n                    color: \"#a78bfa\",\n                    fontWeight: 700,\n                    borderBottom: \"2px solid #4338ca\",\n                    letterSpacing: 0.5\n                  }}>{h}</th>\n                ))}\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              {[\n                [30, Math.sin(60 * Math.PI / 180)],\n                [45, 1],\n                [60, Math.sin(120 * Math.PI / 180)],\n                [75, Math.sin(150 * Math.PI / 180)],\n              ].map(([angle, sinVal], i) => {\n                const range = ((400 * sinVal) / g).toFixed(2);\n                const isHighlight = angle === 45;\n                return (\n                  <tr key={i} style={{\n                    background: isHighlight ? \"#1e1b4b\" : i % 2 === 0 ? \"#0f172a\" : \"#111827\",\n                    borderLeft: isHighlight ? \"3px solid #6366f1\" : \"3px solid transparent\"\n                  }}>\n                    <td style={{ padding: \"10px 14px\", textAlign: \"center\", fontWeight: isHighlight ? 700 : 400, color: isHighlight ? \"#a5b4fc\" : \"#e2e8f0\" }}>\n                      {angle}° {isHighlight ? \"★\" : \"\"}\n                    </td>\n                    <td style={{ padding: \"10px 14px\", textAlign: \"center\", color: \"#94a3b8\" }}>\n                      {sinVal.toFixed(3)}\n                    </td>\n                    <td style={{ padding: \"10px 14px\", textAlign: \"center\", fontWeight: isHighlight ? 700 : 400, color: isHighlight ? \"#34d399\" : \"#e2e8f0\" }}>\n                      {range} m\n                    </td>\n                  </tr>\n                );\n              })}\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n        <div style={{ fontSize: 11, color: \"#6b7280\", marginTop: 8, textAlign: \"right\" }}>\n          ★ = This problem's angle\n        </div>\n      </SectionCard>\n\n      {/* Suggested Questions */}\n      <SectionCard icon=\"🎯\" title=\"Try These Next\" color=\"#f472b6\">\n        <div style={{ display: \"flex\", flexDirection: \"column\", gap: 8 }}>\n          {[\n            \"A ball is thrown at 30° with 40 m/s. Find its range.\",\n            \"At what angle should a ball be thrown to achieve maximum range?\",\n            \"Find the time of flight for this projectile.\",\n            \"What is the maximum height reached?\",\n          ].map((q, i) => (\n            <div key={i} style={{\n              background: \"#1a0a14\",\n              borderRadius: 8,\n              padding: \"10px 14px\",\n              borderLeft: \"3px solid #f472b6\",\n              fontSize: 13,\n              color: \"#fce7f3\",\n              cursor: \"pointer\",\n              display: \"flex\",\n              gap: 10,\n              alignItems: \"center\"\n            }}>\n              <span style={{ color: \"#f472b6\", fontWeight: 700 }}>Q{i + 1}.</span>\n              {q}\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n      </SectionCard>\n\n    </div>\n  );\n}",
